#N canvas 100 100 1450 1100 12;
#X text 20 15 Track 1 reader cut check. Arg: player ID. Uses the original row_1 path.;
#X text 20 40 PLAYER-test-cuts symbol OUTPUT.wav. Attach bounded-player-capture first.;
#X text 20 65 Stops playback at 7s and capture at 8s. Nine cuts 2ms apart begin at 4s.;
